.claude/*

# extracted T10 realizer, regenerated by analysis/kitting/f1_robot_responsible/validate.py
analysis/**/_t10_realizer/

analysis/kitting/f47_fixtures/_scratch/

# The four test-bed sets track reports and code only (.md, .py, .sh; Hadi, 2 October 2026, T-G housekeeping): their
# data and figures stay on disk, untracked, and are regenerated by each set's run script. The instruments and the frozen
# kitting sets stay tracked whole.
analysis/kitting/ir_testbed/**/*.json
analysis/kitting/ir_testbed/**/*.csv
analysis/kitting/ir_testbed/**/*.png
analysis/kitting/mpb/**/*.json
analysis/kitting/mpb/**/*.csv
analysis/kitting/mpb/**/*.png
